Filey changes to DeckCraft's web app (Office work > Slides): the control bridge
(apps/deckcraft-web: deckcraftControl/deckcraftOpen) that lets the Filey agent drive it with
DeckCraft's own control protocol, File > Print handed to Filey (fileyPrintPdf), the app named
"Slides" where users see it, and a startup fix: std::process::id() panics on wasm32.
Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/deckcraft commit a178b9955bd5e31a993a97685eefd07ddadd1478 (main). MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Build: git apply filey-control.patch; cd apps/deckcraft-web; trunk build --release (CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 on 8 GB machines)
Install: node scripts/fetch-office-apps.mjs --app deckcraft --from <deckcraft>/dist/web (copy LICENSE-MIT/APACHE in first)

